{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208570/extras/6c3dd2ba249f91c08dc99b6d44998a02.avif?t=1745510243\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208570/extras_big/6c3dd2ba249f91c08dc99b6d44998a02.avif?t=1745510243 width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Geyserlands </i>is a deck-building game of modern otherworldly mystery. You are a detective just assigned to a national park nobody knows exists.\u00a0 Gain new cards and upgrade your deck as you explore the mystery of <i>Geyserlands</i>. Unlock secret powers and gain special advantages.  But delve too deep and <i>Geyserlands</i> will consume you.  How will your story end in <i>Geyserlands</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208570/extras/e5ebe321dee58ee14b74c47529a27305.avif?t=1745510243\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208570/extras_big/e5ebe321dee58ee14b74c47529a27305.avif?t=1745510243 width=800 height=151 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a deck from hundreds of cards that tell the story of your character's history, abilities, insights and connections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the cards you draw each turn to solve some of <i>Geyserlands</i>' hundreds of mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve mysteries to earn new and better cards and remove weaker cards from your deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape despair and death with a variety of upgradable healing cards that prevent <i>Geyserlands</i> from consuming you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn strange powers and supernatural edges that allow you to push your luck and accomplish the impossible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the secrets of <i>Geyserlands</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However your story ends, you will gain new cards for your next journey.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner's Luck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3208570/44c40ab29b43cf66736f5ae88c80482574472d34.jpg"},{"name":"Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3208570/3bebcb2dce77add879281616a1d8c9f239571962.jpg"},{"name":"Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3208570/9a47a9d651c0b2aa235d072cda533cbd7459873c.jpg"},{"name":"Despair","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3208570/7b5c7a0bec905218799c40f2851c24767caa02c6.jpg"},{"name":"Joy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3208570/f2e56c8116d10b953048ff619a3331c7ce34a947.jpg"},{"name":"Birth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3208570/c382ff090109d49d5f3085b759da167243c6d7a1.jpg"},{"name":"Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3208570/73855843d195298250e5b97ff444774c630ae70d.jpg"},{"name":"Form","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3208570/28c00e2363d9f56300fa464aebb4d8135ae9d128.jpg"},{"name":"Function","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3208570/acc4d255b19c7054075a3afc31100978d3edf895.jpg"},{"name":"Mountain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3208570/bc6d842d54c59d0790d492db788ce7eff0d36bcd.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3208570?t=1745510243","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/s