 of cards that tell the story of your character's history, abilities, insights and connections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the cards you draw each turn to solve some of <i>Geyserlands</i>' hundreds of mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve mysteries to earn new and better cards and remove weaker cards from your deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape despair and death with a variety of upgradable healing cards that prevent <i>Geyserlands</i> from consuming you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn strange powers and supernatural edges that allow you to push your luck and accomplish the impossible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the secrets of <i>Geyserlands</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However your story ends, you will gain new cards for your next journey.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Blazing Nebula"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208570/header.jpg?t=1745510243","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3208570/814871/f19849c0f4de57219ee0ffd74090dcc2ef8618bf/1750881130/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743897276","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3208570/814871/f19849c0f4de57219ee0ffd74090dcc2ef8618bf/1750881130/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743897276","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3208570/814871/f19849c0f4de57219ee0ffd74090dcc2ef8618bf/1750881130/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743897276","id":257090187,"name":"Geyserlands Trailer","t